  "citation": "Chipman D; Takahashi T; Rubin S; Sutherland S; Koshlyakov M H (1997): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained During the R/V Akademik Ioffe Cruise in the South Pacific Ocean (WOCE Section S4P, February-April 1992). CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP063",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
